[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891972\">5580C18</a>\n                                           .</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the safety instructions for working on the system\nvery carefully (\n                                                               <a href=\"#/2891969\">5580C</a>\n                                                                ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p><a href=\"#/2891673\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892174\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891970\">5580C12</a></p><p>Closely observe the safety regulations established for this operation.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891943\">5550A12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections (1a, 1b) from the ignition\nswitch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890354\">H1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890351\">H1A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the ignition switch (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035375.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ignition switch\nis not damaged.</p><p>Fit the switch and fix it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891943\">5550A12</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2891970\">5580C12</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2892174\">7040A26</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2891673\">4110A11</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2891972\">5580C18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Check the operation of the electrical system\nand the steering lock.</p>"]]